        },
        {
          "text": "Haya ndiyo aliyonionesha Bwana MUNGU; tazama, aliumba nzige mwanzo wa kuchipuka kwake mimea wakati wa vuli; na tazama, ilikuwa mimea ya wakati wa vuli baada ya mavuno ya mfalme. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikawa, nzige walipokwisha kula majani ya nchi, ndipo nikasema, Ee Bwana MUNGU, samehe, nakusihi; Yakobo atasimamaje? Kwa maana ni mdogo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
